  "decorativeSymbols": [
    {
      "GUID": "973b6593-d5b4-4da2-8a70-b925775aa685",
      "name": "New annotation",
      "type": "annotation",
      "disableInitialFocus": true,
      "value": "instance types:\n\nDiagnosis\n\nPrescription\n\nCheck-Up / Consultation\n\nLab Test\n\nTreatment / Procedure"
    },
    {
      "GUID": "132b2f32-87d5-499d-ad12-ed674906c82e",
      "name": "New annotation1",
      "type": "annotation",
      "disableInitialFocus": true,
      "value": "Diagnosis\nDescription: A record of a patient's diagnosis made by a healthcare provider.\n\nFields:\n\ndiagnosisId (Unique ID) ->iID (instanceID)\n\npatientId (Reference to the patient)\n\ndoctorId (Reference to the diagnosing doctor)\n\ndiagnosisDate (Date of diagnosis)\n\ndiagnosisCode (e.g., ICD-10 code)\n\ndescription (Detailed description of the diagnosis)\n\nnotes (Additional notes)\n\n2. Prescription\nDescription: A record of medication or treatment prescribed to a patient.\n\nFields:\n\nprescriptionId (Unique ID)\n\npatientId (Reference to the patient)\n\ndoctorId (Reference to the prescribing doctor)\n\nprescriptionDate (Date of prescription)\n\nmedicationName (Name of the medication)\n\ndosage (Dosage instructions)\n\nfrequency (How often the medication should be taken)\n\nduration (Duration of the prescription)\n\nnotes (Additional notes)\n\n3. Check-Up / Consultation\nDescription: A record of a routine check-up or consultation.\n\nFields:\n\ncheckUpId (Unique ID)\n\npatientId (Reference to the patient)\n\ndoctorId (Reference to the consulting doctor)\n\ncheckUpDate (Date of the check-up)\n\nreasonForVisit (Reason for the check-up)\n\nfindings (Findings from the check-up)\n\nrecommendations (Recommendations for the patient)\n\nnotes (Additional notes)\n\n4. Lab Test\nDescription: A record of lab tests ordered for a patient.\n\nFields:\n\nlabTestId (Unique ID)\n\npatientId (Reference to the patient)\n\ndoctorId (Reference to the doctor who ordered the test)\n\ntestDate (Date the test was ordered)\n\ntestType (Type of test, e.g., blood test, urine test)\n\ntestResults (Results of the test)\n\nnotes (Additional notes)\n\n5. Treatment / Procedure\nDescription: A record of a medical treatment or procedure performed on a patient.\n\nFields:\n\ntreatmentId (Unique ID)\n\npatientId (Reference to the patient)\n\ndoctorId (Reference to the doctor performing the treatment)\n\ntreatmentDate (Date of the treatment)\n\ntreatmentType (Type of treatment, e.g., surgery, physiotherapy)\n\ndescription (Detailed description of the treatment)\n\noutcome (Outcome of the treatment)\n\nnotes (Additional notes)\n\n"
    }
  ],
